    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;<i>When aliens order pasta, only one guy can deliver justice!</i>&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They Came for More Pasta</strong> is a <strong>short comedic adventure</strong> inspired in tone by classic graphic adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of <strong>absurd humor, puzzles, exploration, dialogue</strong>, and an incredible alien obsession with Italian cuisine, seasoned with a healthy dose of <strong>sci-fi comedy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739370/extras/bb65d144b6c890365840ee9d49f7192b.webp?t=1750431140\" width=577 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>shocking revelation</strong> is served: <strong>the aliens are here</strong>! But their intentions don't involve lasers, conquest, or abductions. Their sole, irresistible desire is <strong>Italian food</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades of <strong>mysterious UFO sightings</strong>? They weren't preparing for conquest, they weren't analyzing humans. They were just looking for the <strong>best recipes on Earth</strong>. But now things have gotten serious: they're not just tasting anymore, now they want to manage and control <strong>Italian cuisine</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a simple <strong>Italian food delivery guy</strong>, forced to work for the fearsome alien company AlienExpress\u2122. But your life, and with it the fate of the entire Nation, changes when the aliens cross the line by deciding to make you work even on <strong>World Cup Final day</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The most unlikely of heroes</strong>, armed with nothing but carbs and guts, will fight his way through the aliens to defeat their saucy plan and <strong>deliver justice</strong> once and for all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739370/extras/b4bdd026b0a8bcd324df76ed71b4e76d.poster.avif?t=1750431140\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739370/extras/b4bdd026b0a8bcd324df76ed71b4e76d.webm?t=1750431140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739370/extras/b4bdd026b0a8bcd324df76ed71b4e76d.mp4?t=1750431140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739370/extras/49ce712793eca639fbbd2125dc4188fb.webp?t=1750431140\" width=577 height=59 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>graphic adventure</strong> with a <strong>modern</strong>, <strong>controller-friendly</strong> approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>short but intense story</strong> divided into 3 parts, rich in <strong>humor</strong>,<strong> Italian pop culture references</strong>, and, above all, <strong>Italian food</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to <strong>laugh</strong>, think outside the box (and the kitchen), and face <strong>the most important delivery</strong> of your life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of <strong>classic point-and-click graphic adventures</strong> or just looking for a <strong>relaxing experience</strong> with an original story, prepare your keyboard, controller, and forks: the aliens are waiting, and they're very hungry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong>: This game may contain <strong>Pineapple Pizza</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739370/extras/0317f93bb31bad5b7b257996ebb2dde6.webp?t=1750431140\" width=577 height=59 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple-choice dialogues</strong>: Talk to a cast of unforgettable characters, including eccentric humans, alien pizza chefs, and space bureaucrats. Discover extraterrestrial secrets and how to stop the alien invasion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong>: Test your wit with puzzles and enigmas. Use objects in creative and unexpected ways and overcome the environmental challenges you'll encounter along your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: From the uncontrolled traffic of Italian streets to alien spaceship technology, navigating interstellar bureaucratic corridors, offices, and galactic call centers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory System</strong>: Collect items, use them at the right time and place, or give them to someone who knows best how to use them to progress in the adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comic and Original Story</strong>: Immerse yourself in a plot that unfolds through cutscenes, quotes, memorable characters, and a continuous series of increasingly absurd situations caused by the encounter (or clash) between Italian and alien culture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duration</strong>: A short, concentrated adventure (like tomato sauce), lasting about 1 hour, ideal for a pasta-and-pixel weekend or a fun and fulfilling game session.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;<i>When aliens order pasta, only one guy can deliver justice!</i>&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They Came for More Pasta</strong> is a <strong>short comedic adventure</strong> inspired in tone by classic graphic adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of <strong>absurd humor, puzzles, exploration, dialogue</strong>, and an incredible alien obsession with Italian cuisine, seasoned with a healthy dose of <strong>sci-fi comedy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739370/extras/bb65d144b6c890365840ee9d49f7192b.webp?t=1750431140\" width=577 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>shocking revelation</strong> is served: <strong>the aliens are here</strong>! But their intentions don't involve lasers, conquest, or abductions. Their sole, irresistible desire is <strong>Italian food</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades of <strong>mysterious UFO sightings</strong>? They weren't preparing for conquest, they weren't analyzing humans. They were just looking for the <strong>best recipes on Earth</strong>. But now things have gotten serious: they're not just tasting anymore, now they want to manage and control <strong>Italian cuisine</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a simple <strong>Italian food delivery guy</strong>, forced to work for the fearsome alien company AlienExpress\u2122. But your life, and with it the fate of the entire Nation, changes when the aliens cross the line by deciding to make you work even on <strong>World Cup Final day</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The most unlikely of heroes</strong>, armed with nothing but carbs and guts, will fight his way through the aliens to defeat their saucy plan and <strong>deliver justice</strong> once and for all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739370/extras/b4bdd026b0a8bcd324df76ed71b4e76d.poster.avif?t=1750431140\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739370/extras/b4bdd026b0a8bcd324df76ed71b4e76d.webm?t=1750431140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739370/extras/b4bdd026b0a8bcd324df76ed71b4e76d.mp4?t=1750431140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739370/extras/49ce712793eca639fbbd2125dc4188fb.webp?t=1750431140\" width=577 height=59 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>graphic adventure</strong> with a <strong>modern</strong>, <strong>controller-friendly</strong> approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>short but intense story</strong> divided into 3 parts, rich in <strong>humor</strong>,<strong> Italian pop culture references</strong>, and, above all, <strong>Italian food</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to <strong>laugh</strong>, think outside the box (and the kitchen), and face <strong>the most important delivery</strong> of your life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of <strong>classic point-and-click graphic adventures</strong> or just looking for a <strong>relaxing experience</strong> with an original story, prepare your keyboard, controller, and forks: the aliens are waiting, and they're very hungry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong>: This game may contain <strong>Pineapple Pizza</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739370/extras/0317f93bb31bad5b7b257996ebb2dde6.webp?t=1750431140\" width=577 height=59 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple-choice dialogues</strong>: Talk to a cast of unforgettable characters, including eccentric humans, alien pizza chefs, and space bureaucrats. Discover extraterrestrial secrets and how to stop the alien invasion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong>: Test your wit with puzzles and enigmas. Use objects in creative and unexpected ways and overcome the environmental challenges you'll encounter along your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: From the uncontrolled traffic of Italian streets to alien spaceship technology, navigating interstellar bureaucratic corridors, offices, and galactic call centers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory System</strong>: Collect items, use them at the right time and place, or give them to someone who knows best how to use them to progress in the adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comic and Original Story</strong>: Immerse yourself in a plot that unfolds through cutscenes, quotes, memorable characters, and a continuous series of increasingly absurd situations caused by the encounter (or clash) between Italian and alien culture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duration</strong>: A short, concentrated adventure (like tomato sauce), lasting about 1 hour, ideal for a pasta-and-pixel weekend or a fun and fulfilling game session.</p></li></ul>",
